WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.797
- Hang on to something.

00:00:01.797 --> 00:00:04.797
(adventurous music)

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.690
We just got a little ray of sunshine -

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.760
or should I say lightning? -

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.250
because it was just announced
that a "Percy Jackson"

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.960
TV series is in the works,

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.000
so we're gonna break down
what we might see in that,

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.387
right now on The Ketchup.

00:00:17.387 --> 00:00:19.530
"Percy Jackson &amp; the Olympians,"

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.810
about the adventures
of young demigod Percy,

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:24.050
has been one of the
most popular children's

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.370
literature series over the past 15 years.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.120
And now it's becoming
a TV series on Disney+,

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.200
where it could become another tentpole

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.700
to go alongside shows
like "The Mandalorian"

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.757
and perhaps the upcoming Marvel series.

00:00:35.757 --> 00:00:36.590
(doorbell rings)

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.320
- Wanda, welcome home.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.750
- Now, the author of
the books, Rick Riordan,

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.220
along with his wife Becky,
made the big announcement

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.360
on Twitter recently by making
this really cute video.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.699
- Percy Jackson is coming to Disney+.

00:00:49.699 --> 00:00:51.099
Yes!
- Yes!

00:00:51.099 --> 00:00:51.932
- Whoo-hoo!

00:00:51.932 --> 00:00:55.020
- [Naz] And also with a
longer statement from Rick.

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.840
So, in it, he says they are
excited about "a live-action

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.150
series of the highest
quality," adding that it

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:01.797
will follow "the storyline of the original

00:01:01.797 --> 00:01:03.877
five-book series, starting
with 'The Lightning Thief'

00:01:03.877 --> 00:01:06.230
in season one," which is the first book.

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:08.430
But, as you may remember, this same idea

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:11.200
happened back in 2010, but in movie form,

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.447
when the Rotten "Percy
Jackson &amp; the Olympians:

00:01:13.447 --> 00:01:16.460
The Lightning Thief," starring
Logan Lerman, hit theaters.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:18.840
It got decent box office
numbers, but ultimately

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.303
rubbed fans the wrong way.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.323
- I used to date your daddy.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.437
- [Naz] That was followed up by 2013's

00:01:28.437 --> 00:01:31.840
"Percy Jackson: Sea of
Monsters," also Rotten,

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.530
with fans once again not feeling it,

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:36.410
largely due to deviations
from the source material.

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:38.210
So, basically plans for a third film

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.580
were scrapped after that.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.770
- That was... awesome!

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:44.130
- But this time around,
Rick seemingly tried

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.700
to put fans at ease by suggesting

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:48.500
that this adaptation will
be closer to the books,

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.567
saying, "Rest assured
that Becky and I will be

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:53.960
involved in person in
every aspect of the show."

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.820
And that seemed to work, because fans

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.830
on Twitter are absolutely stoked for this

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.710
after waiting so many years,

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:01.580
so thank you, Uncle Rick.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.570
Now, if the series does follow the books

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:05.240
more closely, we should expect to see

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.700
a young Percy discovering
his demigod status

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:10.090
and figuring out his
powers in the first season,

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:12.070
and he could be joined
by other characters,

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:14.010
like Grover Underwood, who in the books

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:16.410
is a forest spirit with a human torso,

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:19.010
and Annabeth Chase, a daughter of Athena.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.290
So, in the book, those two join with Percy

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:23.970
to help him clear his name
after Zeus accuses Percy

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:25.840
of stealing his master lightning bolt.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:27.651
Oh, the demigod drama.

00:02:27.651 --> 00:02:30.290
- I swear, I don't know
how that got there.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:31.470
That's not even my shield!

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.740
- Now, it is reportedly
in the early stages

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.360
of development, but if it does turn out

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.000
to be a hit for Disney+
and sticks to doing

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.320
one book per season, they could also pull

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.890
from "The Demigod Files"
and "The Demigod Diaries"

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:45.930
for more series material
or for potential spin-offs.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.210
I guess it's up to you, the fans.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:49.910
Speaking of which, it is time for us

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:51.090
to kick it over to you guys now.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:53.740
Are you excited for a
"Percy Jackson" TV series,

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.630
and if so, who would you like to see cast?

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.300
Be sure to leave all your
thoughts and feelings

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.320
in the comments section,
and for more streaming news,

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.310
be sure to check out RottenTomatoes.com.

